    "claims": [
      "Quality triggers can be set on inbound and outbound documents and production orders",
      "Supports periodic spot checks of inventory",
      "Failed lots go on hold automatically",
      "Creates follow-up action lists when a check fails",
      "Checks can be assigned to quality teams by location, work center and check type",
      "Configurable scoring criteria decide pass or fail and update lot attributes",
      "Touch-friendly interface for tablets on the warehouse floor",
      "Users can take photos with the device camera and attach them to the check",
      "Keeps full history of checks and actions",
      "Runs checks during production when combined with Aptean Shop Floor Production",
      "Prints a quality report from posted checks including photos",
      "30-day free trial, then paid subscription",
      "Works on Essentials and Premium"
